  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "getting-started",
      "title": "Getting started",
      "anchor": "Getting_started",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:n0sr7s",
          "html": "In <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Seers%27_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seers&#39; Village</a>, go to the house immediately south of the anvil.",
          "text": "In Seers' Village, go to the house immediately south of the anvil.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:5wa82w",
          "html": "Search the bookcase on the eastern wall to find a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Battered_book\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">battered book</a>.",
          "text": "Search the bookcase on the eastern wall to find a battered book.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:1vo59sl",
          "html": "Read the book, then right-click on the book and click &quot;Cut-open&quot; to get a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Battered_key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">battered key</a>. Do not drop the book.",
          "text": "Read the book, then right-click on the book and click \"Cut-open\" to get a battered key. Do not drop the book.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "✓",
                  "text": "[Accept Quest]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:ay7qjy",
          "html": "Go to the building with the anvil and click on the northern wall to open the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Odd-looking_wall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">odd-looking wall</a>.",
          "text": "Go to the building with the anvil and click on the northern wall to open the odd-looking wall.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:1t5q3au",
          "html": "Go down the stairs.",
          "text": "Go down the stairs.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "repairing-a-workshop",
      "title": "Repairing a workshop",
      "anchor": "Repairing_a_workshop",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:7kzyr2",
          "html": "Go into the room to the north.",
          "text": "Go into the room to the north.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:1mxacw",
          "html": "(Red Indicator) Turn the water controls east of the water wheel to turn it green.",
          "text": "(Red Indicator) Turn the water controls east of the water wheel to turn it green.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:425a42",
          "html": "(Red Indicator) Turn the water controls west of the water wheel to turn it green.",
          "text": "(Red Indicator) Turn the water controls west of the water wheel to turn it green.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:c84f6h",
          "html": "Pull the lever by the water wheel. (The wheel should start spinning.)",
          "text": "Pull the lever by the water wheel. (The wheel should start spinning.)",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:hda3d9",
          "html": "(Optional) To obtain <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Leather\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">leather</a>, search the singular <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crate_(Elemental_Workshop_I)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">crate</a> north-west of the hatch in the middle room.",
          "text": "(Optional) To obtain leather, search the singular crate north-west of the hatch in the middle room.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:61v4i0",
          "html": "Go to the eastern room.",
          "text": "Go to the eastern room.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:lp1vi9",
          "html": "With <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Thread\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">thread</a> and leather, fix the bellows.",
          "text": "With thread and leather, fix the bellows.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:51jwmp",
          "html": "Pull the lever by the bellows.",
          "text": "Pull the lever by the bellows.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:bz012v",
          "html": "Go to the western room and mine an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Elemental_rock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">elemental rock</a>.",
          "text": "Go to the western room and mine an elemental rock.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:x2gs9h",
          "html": "Kill the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Earth_elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">earth elemental</a> and pick up the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Elemental_ore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">elemental ore</a> it drops.",
          "text": "Kill the earth elemental and pick up the elemental ore it drops.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "repairing-a-workshop:wyinm9",
          "html": "Go back to the middle room and search the small <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Boxes_(Elemental_Workshop_I)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">boxes</a> north-east of the hatch to obtain <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/A_stone_bowl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">a stone bowl</a>.",
          "text": "Go back to the middle room and search the small boxes north-east of the hatch to obtain a stone bowl.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "finishing-up",
      "title": "Finishing up",
      "anchor": "Finishing_up",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finishing-up:11f23fh",
          "html": "Go to the south room.",
          "text": "Go to the south room.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finishing-up:f1snc8",
          "html": "Use the stone bowl on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lava_trough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lava trough</a> to the south.",
          "text": "Use the stone bowl on the lava trough to the south.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finishing-up:1ckg87h",
          "html": "Use the bowl of lava on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Furnace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">furnace</a> in the room.",
          "text": "Use the bowl of lava on the furnace in the room.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finishing-up:aelzhs",
          "html": "Use the elemental ore and four <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Coal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">coal</a> on the furnace.",
          "text": "Use the elemental ore and four coal on the furnace.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finishing-up:braljz",
          "html": "With the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Slashed_book\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">slashed book</a>, go to the middle room and smith an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Elemental_shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">elemental shield</a> on an anvil workbench.",
          "text": "With the slashed book, go to the middle room and smith an elemental shield on an anvil workbench.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "finishing-up:fvxipr",
          "html": "Quest complete!",
          "text": "Quest complete!",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    }
